# Placeholder defaults for the Base44 development environment.
#
# The environment's start command is invoked with
#   docker compose --env-file /app/.env.base44-defaults ...
# so this file must exist or compose exits before starting any service.
#
# Keep only non-secret placeholders here. Real credentials belong in the
# encrypted app secret store, which the platform delivers to
# /run/base44/app.env (wired as the LAST env_file entry in the compose file,
# so it always overrides anything set here).
#
# This repository has no application code yet, so it needs no variables.
